#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:3
msgid "Vale Integration"
msgstr "Vale samþætting"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:10
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Yfirlit"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:12
msgid ""
"Snapper ships a vale style package with two rules that flag lines needing "
"semantic line breaks. For precise enforcement, use ``snapper --check`` "
"directly in CI."
msgstr ""
"Snapper fylgir vale stílpakka með tveimur reglum sem merkja línur sem þurfa "
"merkingarbær línuskipti. Fyrir nákvæma framfylgd, notaðu ``snapper --check`` "
"beint í CI."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:18
msgid "Style package setup"
msgstr "Uppsetning stílpakka"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:20
msgid "Add the snapper vale style to your ``.vale.ini``:"
msgstr "Bættu snapper vale stílnum við ``.vale.ini`` skrána þína:"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:39
msgid "Bundled rules"
msgstr "Meðfylgjandi reglur"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:41
msgid "``SemanticLineBreaks``"
msgstr "``SemanticLineBreaks``"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:42
msgid ""
"Flags lines containing multiple sentences (a period followed by a space and "
"a capital letter on the same line)."
msgstr ""
"Merkir línur sem innihalda margar setningar (punktur á eftir bili og stórum "
"staf á sömu línu)."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:44
msgid "Level: warning."
msgstr "Stig: viðvörun."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:46
msgid "``LongProseLine``"
msgstr "``LongProseLine``"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:47
msgid "Flags prose lines exceeding 120 characters."
msgstr "Merkir textalínur sem fara yfir 120 stafi."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:49
msgid "Level: suggestion."
msgstr "Stig: tillaga."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:51
msgid "``SnapperCheck``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:52
msgid ""
"External action. Runs ``snapper --check --output-format json`` and reports "
"``fused`` / ``wrap`` on the matching lines when ``snapper`` is on ``PATH``. "
"Advisory ``long`` stays on ``LongProseLine``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:59
msgid "Precise CI enforcement"
msgstr "Nákvæm CI-framfylgd"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:61
msgid ""
"The vale rules use regex heuristics. For accurate checking, use the "
"formatter directly:"
msgstr ""
"Vale reglurnar nota reglulega segð sem heuristic. Fyrir nákvæma athugun, "
"notaðu sníðmótunartólið beint:"

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:68
msgid ""
"This catches all cases the regex rules miss (abbreviations, inline tokens, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Þetta nær öllum tilvikum sem reglulegu segðirnar missa af (skammstöfunum, "
"innleiddum táknum, o.fl.)."

#: ../../source/howto/vale-integration.rst:73
msgid "Combining vale and snapper"
msgstr "Sameina vale og snapper"

